OL,3,ABoy, 13, is new voice of Thomas the
OL,4,ATank Engine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old schoolboy has made his
OL,7,Fvoice-acting debut as Thomas the Tank
OL,8,FEngine in a new animated series.
OL,10,FHarry Sparkes, from Harpenden,
OL,11,FHertfordshire, stars in Thomas &
OL,12,FFriends: Railway Stories alongside
OL,13,FCrazy Rich Asians actor Henry Golding,
OL,14,Fwho narrates the series in a role made
OL,15,Ffamous by Sir Ringo Starr.
OL,17,FFor nine months, Sparkes kept his
OL,18,Fweekly recording sessions secret from
OL,19,Fhis classmates by telling them he was
OL,20,Fattending physiotherapy for a foot
OL,21,Finjury.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
