OL,3,ABoy, 13, is new voice of Thomas the
OL,4,ATank Engine
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It feels amazing, because I played and
OL,7,Fwatched Thomas as a kid, and now I get
OL,8,Fto be Thomas. It just feels insane," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
